{"book":"job","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:46:14.637487807Z","verse":21,"ref":"job 7:21","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":7,"translation":"And why ⟨will⟩ you not lift ⟨up⟩ my transgression, and cause ⟨את⟩ my iniquity to pass away? For now I will lie down ⟨in⟩ the dust, and you will seek me — but I ⟨will⟩ not ⟨be⟩.","tokens":[{"surface":"ומה","gloss":"And why"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תשא","gloss":"will you lift"},{"surface":"פשעי","gloss":"my transgression"},{"surface":"ותעביר","gloss":"and cause to pass away"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"my iniquity"},{"surface":"עוני","gloss":"my iniquity"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"עתה","gloss":"now"},{"surface":"לעפר","gloss":"to the dust"},{"surface":"אשכב","gloss":"I shall lie down"},{"surface":"ושחרתני","gloss":"and you will seek me"},{"surface":"ואינני","gloss":"and I am not"}]}